{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES MEET CUSTOMERS' NEEDS WITH ON-DEMAND DELIVERY IN NEW YORK CITY", 'text': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES ANNOUNCED THEIR COLLABORATION  DESIGNED TO  PROVIDE QUICK, CONVENIENT,  ON-DEMAND DELIVERY FOR  CUSTOMERS LOOKING FOR OVER-THE-COUNTER MEDICATIONS, HEALTH AND WELLNESS, BEAUTY AND GROCERY PRODUCTS. POSTMATES WILL DELIVER HUNDREDSOF WALGREENS' MOST POPULAR ITEMS FROM 174 WALGREENS AND DUANE READE LOCATIONS IN MANHATTAN AND BROOKLYN. BRINGING TOGETHER THE SCALE OF WALGREENS WITH THE ON-DEMAND DELIVERY SERVICE OF POSTMATES WILL ALLOW BOTH BUSINESSES TO BETTER MEET THE NEEDS OF THEIR CUSTOMERS. POSTMATES FOUND THAT ITS CUSTOMERS ARE SEEKING MANY OF THE EVERYDAY ITEMS FOUND AT WALGREENS. FOR EXAMPLE, THE TOP ITEMS NEW YORKERS ORDER ARE SMART WATER, GATORADE, SAN PELLEGRINO, TYLENOL AND PEDIALYTE.  FURTHER, DURING LAST FLU SEASON, FROM AUGUST 2018 TO JANUARY 2019, POSTMATES SAW A 173% INCREASE IN ORDERS FOR COUGH RELIEF ITEMS, A 111% INCREASE IN SINUS RELIEF AIDS AND A 50%SPIKE IN SOUP ORDERS."}{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2019-10-01 22:30:00', 'title': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES MEET CUSTOMERS' NEEDS WITH ON-DEMAND DELIVERY IN NEW YORK CITY", 'text': "WALGREENS AND POSTMATES ANNOUNCED THEIR COLLABORATION  DESIGNED TO  PROVIDE QUICK, CONVENIENT,  ON-DEMAND DELIVERY FOR  CUSTOMERS LOOKING FOR OVER-THE-COUNTER MEDICATIONS, HEALTH AND WELLNESS, BEAUTY AND GROCERY PRODUCTS. POSTMATES WILL DELIVER HUNDREDSOF WALGREENS' MOST POPULAR ITEMS FROM 174 WALGREENS AND DUANE READE LOCATIONS IN MANHATTAN AND BROOKLYN. BRINGING TOGETHER THE SCALE OF WALGREENS WITH THE ON-DEMAND DELIVERY SERVICE OF POSTMATES WILL ALLOW BOTH BUSINESSES TO BETTER MEET THE NEEDS OF THEIR CUSTOMERS. POSTMATES FOUND THAT ITS CUSTOMERS ARE SEEKING MANY OF THE EVERYDAY ITEMS FOUND AT WALGREENS. FOR EXAMPLE, THE TOP ITEMS NEW YORKERS ORDER ARE SMART WATER, GATORADE, SAN PELLEGRINO, TYLENOL AND PEDIALYTE.  FURTHER, DURING LAST FLU SEASON, F